# Crossroads: four avenues meet in a plaza. Enemies march in from the far
# end of every avenue; the crates at the plaza's corners are the cover.
#
#   #  wall (wall_height)   =  crate (crate_height)   O  pillar
#   P  player start         E  enemy spawn            .  floor
# One character is `tile` metres; the '#' border is the outer wall.

name          Crossroads
tile          2
wall_height   3.0
crate_height  1.0
pillar_height 6

map
